{
  "id": "g-dd-sales-channels-low-code",
  "name": "Sales Channels (low-code)",
  "description": "The channel budget page: the revenue mix today, what an order is worth in each channel, where the mix is moving month by month, and what each channel sells. One checkbox switches every tile between revenue net of returns and gross.",
